Usage:
  yui session self-play [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string          OpenAI API key; may also come from the configured AGENT_MODEL__OPENAI__API_KEY
      --base-url string         Optional OpenAI Realtime WebSocket endpoint override
  -h, --help                    help for self-play
      --max-duration duration   Positive maximum run duration (default: 2m) (default 2m0s)
      --max-turns int           Positive completed-turn target per side (default: 3) (default 3)
      --model string            OpenAI Realtime model (default: gpt-realtime) (default "gpt-realtime")
      --output-dir string       Empty directory for this self-play run (required)
      --provider string         Phase 1 realtime provider (openai only) (default "openai")

Global Flags:
      --allow-path stringArray   Additional filesystem-tool root (repeatable; relative to --workdir)
  -C, --config-dir string        Directory for agent CLI config (default: ~/.agent-cli)
      --log-to-stdout            Log to stdout/stderr instead of file (default: logs to file in config directory)
  -v, --verbose count            Enable verbose output (use -v for info, -vv for debug)
      --workdir string           Filesystem-tool workdir (default: the process current directory)
